    {
      "name": "a failure delivered to a then yield wait reaches catch only after its turn",
      "document": "kernel 1\nnumbers by_spelling\neffect echo(value: Int) -> Int\neffect fails(value: Int) -> Int\nfn guarded() { try { let a = perform fails(1) as Int then yield print a } catch e { print \"caught\" } return null }\nfn other() { let b = perform echo(2) as Int print b return b }\n\nmain {\nlet x = spawn call guarded()\nlet y = spawn call other()\nlet tasks = [x, y]\ndo join all tasks\nfinish null\n}\n",
      "expected": {
        "prints": [
          {
            "int": "20"
          },
          {
            "text": "caught"
          }
        ],
        "end": {
          "finished": "null"
        },
        "trace": [
